herdr agent read wgka --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > $ORCH_INBOX/wgka.last
```

`park-wgka-b8.txt`:

> Your step-6 question is ballot B8, now with the two voting advisors. It is not decided. Until I relay the result: do not implement step 6, do not pick either range provisionally, and do not add a variable that stands in for the choice. Continue only with plan steps that do not read the allow-list, under superpowers:test-driven-development, local commits only; if there are none, park. Ignore pre-filled input text. Reply in English: what you did or "parked", branch, head SHA, steps blocked on B8.

